{"seq":3,"slug":"sequential-recommendation","title":"序列推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-algorithms/sequential-recommendation","wordCount":847,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"序列推荐\">序列推荐</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>序列推荐（Sequential Recommendation）将用户的行为序列建模为时序信号，预测用户下一个可能交互的物品。与传统推荐方法将用户行为视为无序集合不同，序列推荐捕获用户兴趣的时序演变模式和物品之间的顺序依赖关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 用户行为序列&#10;        I1[物品1] --&gt; I2[物品2]&#10;        I2 --&gt; I3[物品3]&#10;        I3 --&gt; I4[物品4]&#10;        I4 --&gt; PRED[预测下一个?]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 序列模型&#10;        RNN[RNN/GRU]&#10;        CNN_S[CNN]&#10;        ATT[Self-Attention]&#10;        GNN_S[图序列]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 用户行为序列\n        I1[物品1] --&gt; I2[物品2]\n        I2 --&gt; I3[物品3]\n        I3 --&gt; I4[物品4]\n        I4 --&gt; PRED[预测下一个?]\n    end\n    subgraph 序列模型\n        RNN[RNN/GRU]\n        CNN_S[CNN]\n        ATT[Self-Attention]\n        GNN_S[图序列]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>序列建模</th>\n<th>长距离依赖</th>\n<th>训练效率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GRU4Rec</td>\n<td>GRU</td>\n<td>循环</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Caser</td>\n<td>CNN</td>\n<td>局部模式</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SASRec</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>自注意力</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BERT4Rec</td>\n<td>双向Transformer</td>\n<td>掩码预测</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SR-GNN</td>\n<td>图神经网络</td>\n<td>图结构</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FMLP-Rec</td>\n<td>纯MLP</td>\n<td>频域滤波</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于自注意力的序列推荐\">基于自注意力的序列推荐</h2><p>SASRec（Self-Attentive Sequential Recommendation）将 Transformer 的自注意力机制引入序列推荐，是当前最主流的序列推荐架构。它将用户的行为序列类比为 &quot;句子&quot;，每个物品类比为 &quot;词&quot;，通过自注意力捕获序列中任意位置之间的依赖关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SASRecConfig {&#10;  maxSeqLength: number;&#10;  embeddingDim: number;&#10;  numHeads: number;&#10;  numBlocks: number;&#10;  dropout: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function sasrecForward(&#10;  itemSequence: string[],&#10;  itemEmbeddings: Map&lt;string, Float32Array&gt;,&#10;  positionEmbeddings: Float32Array[],&#10;  attentionBlocks: AttentionBlock[],&#10;  mask: boolean[],&#10;): Float32Array {&#10;  let hidden = itemSequence.map((item, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const itemEmb = itemEmbeddings.get(item) ?? new Float32Array(positionEmbeddings[0].length);&#10;    return addVec(itemEmb, positionEmbeddings[i]);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  for (const block of attentionBlocks) {&#10;    hidden = causalSelfAttention(hidden, mask, block);&#10;    hidden = hidden.map((h) =&gt; feedForward(h, block.ffn));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return hidden[hidden.length - 1];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function causalSelfAttention(sequences: Float32Array[], mask: boolean[], block: AttentionBlock): Float32Array[] {&#10;  const seqLen = sequences.length;&#10;  const dim = sequences[0].length;&#10;  const headDim = dim / block.numHeads;&#10;&#10;  const queries = sequences.map((s) =&gt; matVecMul(block.wQ, s));&#10;  const keys = sequences.map((s) =&gt; matVecMul(block.wK, s));&#10;  const values = sequences.map((s) =&gt; matVecMul(block.wV, s));&#10;&#10;  const outputs: Float32Array[] = [];&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; seqLen; i++) {&#10;    const scores: number[] = [];&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt;= i; j++) {&#10;      if (!mask[j]) {&#10;        scores.push(-Infinity);&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;      scores.push(dotProduct(queries[i], keys[j]) / Math.sqrt(headDim));&#10;    }&#10;    for (let j = i + 1; j &lt; seqLen; j++) {&#10;      scores.push(-Infinity);&#10;    }&#10;    const weights = softmax(new Float32Array(scores));&#10;    const output = weightedSum(values, weights);&#10;    outputs.push(output);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return outputs;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-col